      "id": "claim_da471133535d4d1ba6a6249d8865a283",
      "statement": "Adjusters must investigate prior water, leakage, seepage, humidity, fungi, mold, repairs, remediation, and related claims, but a prior loss or payment does not automatically bar or establish coverage for the current claim.",
